  "approval": {
    "status": "tool-fixture-only",
    "source": "Fixed finite 1750 center opening, ordinary construction rates, Float production completion500, twelve tank attack; checkpoint margins independently fixed before run; no original equivalence; R1 continuation uses the same real produced builder and constructed factory: damage, free repair, pending-production reclaim and next-update site reuse; 1200 HP / binary32 1.02 and 700 * Double(0.8f), original 35 assertions retained"
